<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pengumuman Support Himpunan 2025</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a2e;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            background: #16213e;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 90%;
        }
        h1 { color: #0f3460; }
        .btn {
            background-color: #e94560;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #d1304a; transform: scale(1.05); }
        #card {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #0f3460;
            border-radius: 10px;
            animation: fadeIn 1s;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .highlight { color: #e94560; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>Kabinet Vektorisasi</h2>
    <p>Ada pesan rahasia untukmu dari Ketua Himpunan...</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="revealCard()">Buka Surat</button>

    <div id="card">
        <h3>🎉 SELAMAT! 🎉</h3>
        <p>Kamu resmi terpilih menjadi bagian dari <br><span class="highlight">Support Himpunan 2025!</span></p>
        <p>Mari ciptakan momentum, bergerak serentak, dan buktikan dedikasi kita. Persiapkan dirimu untuk kolaborasi hebat ke depan!</p>
        <p><em>- Semangat brookk!</em></p>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function revealCard() {
        document.getElementById("card").style.display = "block";
        document.querySelector(".btn").style.display = "none";
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
